WEBVTT

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.220
Magic Knight Rayearth
I, Umi Ryuuzaki, along with
Hikaru Shidou and Fuu Hououji...

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.980
I, Umi Ryuuzaki, along with
Hikaru Shidou and Fuu Hououji...

00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:13.120
...was summoned back
to the world called Cephiro.

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:17.790
This country lost the Pillar who
supported it, Princess Emeraude...

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.660
...and was facing total destruction.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:24.170
Three countries were invading
in hopes of taking Cephiro...

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:28.300
...but there's also
an unknown force after Cephiro.

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:31.070
One of the attacking
countries is Fahren.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.740
But Fahren's
imperial princess, Aska...

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:38.280
...decided against becoming
Cephiro's Pillar after talking with Fuu.

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:42.880
Aska was worried about us
and used a giant Sang Yung...

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:46.920
...to capture Autozam's battleship,
which was parked by the castle...

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:49.490
...and flew off somewhere with it.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.290
However, Eagle from Autozam,
who's still in the castle...

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:57.500
...made his move to get
his hands on the proof of the Pillar.

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.460
It will be mine.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.970
I feel it trembling
in the bottom of my heart...

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:13.780
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:19.220
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:25.400
And my love, full of pride,
comes to life right in front of me.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:33.440
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:35.840
The warm, red
shades of the sunset...

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:40.430
...have a melancholy beauty.

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:46.620
Solitary tears fall into
the sea that I sealed away...

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:50.350
...inside my heart.

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:54.620
The bright light that I missed
will not come back to me.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:02:00.860
So I want freedom, just like the wind
that will come with the next sunrise.

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:08.530
I feel it trembling in
the bottom of my heart...

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:13.210
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:18.710
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:22.890
Someday I want to find for myself...

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:29.120
...a future that has no end.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:38.060
The Crown Room and the Pillar's Memory

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:27.640
The one from Autozam?

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:47.030
This is...

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:51.570
Who's there?

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:03.650
Lord Zagato!

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:14.530
Lord Zagato...

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.300
You're not him...

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:34.580
Does it hurt?

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:38.820
You're...

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.990
Zagato was my elder brother.

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:49.970
It looks like Debonair's
spell on you has broken.

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.600
Lady Debonair...

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:59.110
You can hear my voice, can't you?

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:05.910
Alcyone, tell me.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:08.010
Where is Debonair?

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:18.790
I feel Debonair's evil presence
from all over this country.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:23.930
Yet wherever in Cephiro I look,
I cannot find that woman.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:26.800
Where is Debonair?

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:52.200
Everything concerning Debonair...

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:54.500
...is sealed away.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:09.480
Apparently, the dragon
from Fahren has moved!

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:12.020
Now that the huge kid is gone...

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:15.580
...we're going to fix everything
on the NSX right away!

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:16.650
Zazu!

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:17.690
Yeah?

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:20.880
How much longer till we can move?

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:24.660
If I could have
three hours Autozam time...

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.660
I'm counting on you!

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.270
Don't die on us...

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.400
...Eagle.

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:52.050
As I heard about from Lantis,
the keys that open the crown room...

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:55.520
...are Master Mage Clef's
ring and Lantis's sword.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:59.930
I don't have biological data
on Master Mage Clef.

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:01.290
That means...

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:08.140
I'll have to ask Lantis
to give me a hand.

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:30.860
You know he's not
going to love you back...

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:33.760
Why are you falling for him?

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:44.530
What's that sound?

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:47.080
Hikaru, Umi, Fuu!

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:48.570
Mr. Clef.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:52.840
What's going on?

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:57.950
The one from Autozam is free
and running around the castle!

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.490
Eagle...

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:03.490
Let's go!

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:16.340
Eagle.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:22.010
Sorry to bother you right now.

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.890
You were hiding even more weapons.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:34.450
It's nothing special...

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:37.660
...but it will do the job right now.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:22.670
Winds of Protection!

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:28.200
This way?

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:34.350
Sapphire Whirlwind!

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:41.150
Is it that way?

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:44.220
Why are there explosions all over?

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:47.960
There's only one Autozam
commander on the run!

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:56.640
Since there are so many explosions,
I can't tell which way to go!

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:59.370
Let us split up.

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:02.780
Even if the commander
is not around...

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:06.580
...we must do something
about all the explosives.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.850
I'll go this way.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.320
Umi, can you take the way we came?

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.090
Fuu, downstairs please.

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:16.460
Right.

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:38.380
When I decide something,
I execute it no matter what happens.

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.340
Just like you.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:45.380
Geo was saying that
the thing we have in common...

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:49.030
...is that we're both
too stubborn for him to handle.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.520
I have a wish.

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:57.260
A wish I cannot change.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:02.400
If you aren't going
to fight me seriously...

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:05.510
...you will be the one to die.

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:26.290
Lightning...

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:29.360
...Call!

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:33.070
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:37.640
Autozam
Geo
Eagle
Zazu

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:40.080
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:43.610
Lantis Primera
Cephiro

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:51.020
Is that him?

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:20.080
Lantis!

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:39.060
The ring...

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.340
This is...

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:57.980
The crown room...

00:12:58.820 --> 00:12:59.810
Why?

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:01.860
Why are we here?

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:11.300
This is where
the proof of the Pillar lies.

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:39.690
The shape of
the crown has changed.

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:44.430
Does that mean there's someone
who can become the next Pillar?

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:46.670
Wait!

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.670
Don't. There's a magic ward...

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:54.670
I can't move.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:58.940
Only one who is qualified
may enter that room!

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:03.350
I know.

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:07.980
That's why I'm going to test
myself and see if I'm qualified.

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:13.450
Stop!

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.220
You can't! Eagle!

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:44.990
No, that is not true.

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:46.390
Cephiro is...

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:38.380
Princess Emeraude.

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:43.820
The guard captain who will
protect you has been appointed.

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:48.030
Master Mage Clef, rather than
worry about protecting me...

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:50.290
...please protect Cephiro's people.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:56.270
Protecting you leads
to protecting Cephiro.

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:08.210
Lantis, the only one qualified to be
called a magic swordsman in Cephiro.

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:16.980
And the high priest who will aid
you with your prayers as the Pillar.

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:23.790
Please call me Zagato...

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:26.030
...Princess Emeraude.

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:57.920
Zagato...

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:09.900
Lantis has disappeared.

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:13.570
Why...

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:17.680
I do not know.

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:21.720
However, he seems
to have left Cephiro altogether.

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.810
I cannot feel his presence anywhere.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:31.090
Shall I look for him?

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:33.490
No.

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:38.320
Knowing Lantis,
he has some idea in his mind.

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:40.700
Leave him be.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:43.340
As you wish.

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:09.530
I shall summon...

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:11.430
...the Magic Knights.

00:18:12.340 --> 00:18:13.740
You mustn't!

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:16.640
If you summon
the Magic Knights, you will...

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:20.370
I am...

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:23.380
...in love with Zagato.

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:27.980
I can't be forgiven.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:32.280
I know I can't be forgiven...

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.780
...but I can't do anything about it.

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:42.260
It's my own heart, and yet I can't...

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:49.700
I knew about you and Zagato.

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:55.280
Princess, you are
the Pillar of this world!

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:58.180
But before that, you are a person!

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:02.550
Even if you wish
only for your happiness...

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.750
...nobody can blame you!

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:12.960
Even if everyone else forgave me...

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:15.830
...I could never forgive myself.

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:21.630
I know that misfortune will
befall the people of this country...

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:24.670
Making myself happy is something...

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:26.940
...I cannot do.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.920
Princess Emeraude!

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:49.170
Master Mage Clef...

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:53.630
Please guide the Magic Knights
that I will now summon.

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:57.370
It will be a difficult battle.

00:19:57.480 --> 00:20:02.440
These Magic Knights I am involving
solely due to my own selfishness...

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:04.450
Please help them.

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:05.680
Princess!

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:08.910
Tell the Magic Knights...

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:10.910
...that I'm sorry.

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:15.450
Princess Emeraude!

00:20:56.430 --> 00:20:57.730
Zagato...

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:02.430
Finally, I am yours and only yours.

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:16.320
Cephiro is...

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:20.160
...a land for everyone who lives there.

00:21:22.660 --> 00:21:27.430
And the person who will
determine the fate of this country...

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:29.330
...is you.

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:49.580
They both emerged
from the crown room.

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:55.820
The only one who can leave
that room alive is the Pillar.

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:01.990
Which one...

00:22:03.730 --> 00:22:06.000
...will become the Pillar?

00:22:14.380 --> 00:22:21.510
Shine someday.
Believing is just that.

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:31.030
Because it gives me
the courage to live on now.

00:22:33.100 --> 00:22:39.200
Blown by the winds of the ages.

00:22:40.570 --> 00:22:45.670
Groping around for tomorrow.

00:22:48.110 --> 00:22:53.740
Darkness spreads,
and only worries...

00:22:55.420 --> 00:23:00.450
...keep welling up.

00:23:02.760 --> 00:23:08.530
I will definitely find bright feelings...

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:15.230
...when I get over the sea of tears.

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:24.540
Someday I will find it,
and the unyielding future...

00:23:25.180 --> 00:23:33.820
...will lead dreams
to a world full of light.

00:23:47.200 --> 00:23:50.170
I'm Eagle Vision of Autozam.

00:23:50.540 --> 00:23:53.510
I came out of
the crown room with Hikaru.

00:23:53.610 --> 00:23:57.570
Which of us did
the proof of the Pillar choose?

00:23:58.380 --> 00:24:00.350
The NSX is being repaired...

00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:05.180
...but this time Chizeta's Bravada
is making its way to Cephiro again.

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:07.920
Next time on Magic Knight Rayearth...

